00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,434
Now we can answer the question from the very start.

2
00:00:02,434 --> 00:00:06,575
Why does the sal trunk thicken while the bamboo never does?

3
00:00:06,575 --> 00:00:08,580
Look at a monocot bundle.

4
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,791
It is closed.

5
00:00:09,791 --> 00:00:13,203
There is no cambium between its xylem and phloem.

